{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The demo version has limited content. After landing on the island, you will not be able to develop further, clear dungeons and trade with residents. In order to unlock all these features, purchase the full version of the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are a stranger in this world. And you will remain a stranger forever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey across the endless ocean, where every island holds both danger and opportunity. Build a floating fortress, assemble your crew, explore lost lands, and battle ancient creatures lurking in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features:</strong> <br>\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Raft Survival</strong> \u2013 build, upgrade, and defend your floating home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/052176eec0cc052e26c59105570052fd.poster.avif?t=1753109348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/052176eec0cc052e26c59105570052fd.webm?t=1753109348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/052176eec0cc052e26c59105570052fd.mp4?t=1753109348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdd <strong>Island Exploration</strong> \u2013 gather resources, uncover secrets, and encounter local inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/7d5621a9c1cfd0ab0a29bf2b8fea007f.poster.avif?t=1753109348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/7d5621a9c1cfd0ab0a29bf2b8fea007f.webm?t=1753109348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/7d5621a9c1cfd0ab0a29bf2b8fea007f.mp4?t=1753109348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694 <strong>Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 fight against mythical beasts guarding the rarest treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/89b7e32e48ac9503169a4703d7b1082e.poster.avif?t=1753109348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/89b7e32e48ac9503169a4703d7b1082e.webm?t=1753109348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/89b7e32e48ac9503169a4703d7b1082e.mp4?t=1753109348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Crafting &amp; Resource Management</strong> \u2013 create gear, upgrade weapons, and manage your crew. <br>\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Crew Recruitment</strong> \u2013 gather allies, train them, and send them on missions. <br>\ud83c\udfda <strong>Slave Villages &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 enslave islanders, force them to gather resources, construct buildings, and strengthen your control over the islands. Upgrade settlements to increase production and influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you prove that even a stranger can survive? Or will the ocean claim you like all those before you?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853880?t=1753109348","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/baf0a4fe4cf577dcc3a20e894248c1ddbe40fb9e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753109348","capsule_image":"https://shared.akama