amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/052176eec0cc052e26c59105570052fd.webm?t=1753109348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/052176eec0cc052e26c59105570052fd.mp4?t=1753109348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdd <strong>Island Exploration</strong> \u2013 gather resources, uncover secrets, and encounter local inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/7d5621a9c1cfd0ab0a29bf2b8fea007f.poster.avif?t=1753109348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/7d5621a9c1cfd0ab0a29bf2b8fea007f.webm?t=1753109348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/7d5621a9c1cfd0ab0a29bf2b8fea007f.mp4?t=1753109348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694 <strong>Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 fight against mythical beasts guarding the rarest treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/89b7e32e48ac9503169a4703d7b1082e.poster.avif?t=1753109348\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/89b7e32e48ac9503169a4703d7b1082e.webm?t=1753109348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/extras/89b7e32e48ac9503169a4703d7b1082e.mp4?t=1753109348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Crafting &amp; Resource Management</strong> \u2013 create gear, upgrade weapons, and manage your crew. <br>\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Crew Recruitment</strong> \u2013 gather allies, train them, and send them on missions. <br>\ud83c\udfda <strong>Slave Villages &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 enslave islanders, force them to gather resources, construct buildings, and strengthen your control over the islands. Upgrade settlements to increase production and influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you prove that even a stranger can survive? Or will the ocean claim you like all those before you?</p>","developers":["Yagir.inc"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3537680","name":"Sea of Trials"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853880/46e7ba518dcf3e89b2e960bed385817f123a9fe0/header.jpg?t=1753109348","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257170316,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170316/movie480.mp4?t=1753109346","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170316/movie_max.mp4?t=1753109346"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257170316/147b26786e110a73d586ce60e2e8fe3bff21628f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753109346","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170316/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753109346","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170316/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753109346"}}],"name":"Sea of Trials Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=